29cbd387 [deepseek-flash] #The min/max bookkeeping is now on the right side of the cutoff — `slopSeconds` is pure and
29cbd387 [deepseek-flash] #`slopDate` is only called for lines that are actually kept. So the final `from … to …` line now
29cbd387 [deepseek-flash] #describes the refined window. That's the fix you wanted.
29cbd387 [deepseek-flash] #
29cbd387 [deepseek-flash] #A few remaining odds and ends:
29cbd387 [deepseek-flash] #
