29ced87a [deepseek-flash] #• Common failure modes on Arch:*
29ced87a [deepseek-flash] #
29ced87a [deepseek-flash] #- Driver/package version skew after an upgrade → reboot, or downgrade `nvidia-utils` to
29ced87a [deepseek-flash] #match the loaded module.
