29ced87a [deepseek-flash] #-Q linux` and whether you have `linux-headers` installed for DKMS builds (`nvidia-dkms`).
29ced87a [deepseek-flash] #- Secure Boot blocking unsigned modules → `mokutil --sb-state`, sign the module or disable
29ced87a [deepseek-flash] #Secure Boot.
29ced87a [deepseek-flash] #- Wayland/compositor issues are separate from CUDA — `nvidia-smi` and PyTorch can work fine
29ced87a [deepseek-flash] #even if the desktop is glitchy.
