29cef74b [deepseek-flash] #
29cef74b [deepseek-flash] #
29cef74b [deepseek-flash] #Whichever of those succeeds tells you the model path is fine and only the `source=` line in
29cef74b [deepseek-flash] #`run.sh` needs fixing. Paste `cat run.sh` and the `ak1.txt` head and I’ll give you the exact
