2adbf6c1 [gemini-4-argon] #1. Shovel Collision: In `spec.shortcode`, `"shovel"` is currently mapped to `"🫷"`
2adbf6c1 [gemini-4-argon] #(Rightwards Pushing Hand, U+1FAF7), which duplicates `"rightwards_pushing_hand"`. The Unicode 16.0
2adbf6c1 [gemini-4-argon] #codepoint for shovel is `🪏` (U+1FA8F), or `⛏️` (Pick) / `🥄` (Spoon) for older standards.
2adbf6c1 [gemini-4-argon] #2. Phoenix Mapping: In `spec.shortcode`, `"phoenix"` is mapped to `"🪶"` (Feather), whereas
2adbf6c1 [gemini-4-argon] #in `spec.fenced.code.birds`, the ZWJ sequence `"🐦‍🔥"` (Phoenix) is present.
2adbf6c1 [gemini-4-argon] #3. New Additions: The inclusion of `internet.pipes` (subsea cables), `technology`
2adbf6c1 [gemini-4-argon] #(optoelectronics timelines), `food` taxonomies, and `systemic fails` provides a strong
2adbf6c1 [gemini-4-argon] #cross-disciplinary anchor alongside the linguistic and Unicode blocks.
